{
  "description": "Hardware-key factory reset (issue eink-ha-os#21) and restart (Power + Left 5 s, issue eink-ha-os#226; emulator src/core/recovery.ts). Power alone (issue eink-ha-os#258): released before power_off_hold_ms = press (standby / wake), held that long = off; a Power hold counts only after Power was seen released since boot. Each case starts from recoveryInit(), or recoveryOffer(offer) when `offer` (ms) is set (boot after a crash loop). Steps feed recoveryStep(state, t, keys) in order; keys = letters held or pressed since the last sample: P = Power, R = Right, L = Left, O = other (Home key, touch); \"\" = none. Each step expects the action and the phase after it. crash_loops: boot-ring reset reasons newest first → crashStreak / isCrashLoop.",
